  "id": "tge-labs/mgrs",
  "title": "Cloud Native MGRS",
  "description": "A complete Military Grid Reference System (MGRS) 1-kilometer reference grid derived from National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency (NGA) data, stored in cloud-native GeoParquet format. Contains over 305 million grid cells covering the global extent from -80\u00b0 to 84\u00b0 latitude, with each cell encoded as a polygon geometry alongside standardized MGRS codes, Grid Zone Designators, and 10-kilometer tile identifiers.",
